4796,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNTI4NDc5Ng==","number":62,"title":"1.5.0.CR1","description":"","creator":{"login":"emmanuelbernard","id":300760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDc2MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/300760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard","html_url":"https://github.com/emmanuelbernard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":397,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-04-07T13:38:08Z","updated_at":"2020-07-21T13:05:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-05-20T19:24:13Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2020-05-10T16:03:00Z","updated_at":"2020-06-01T01:03:22Z","closed_at":"2020-05-11T22:21:33Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nThe gelf handler chunking the messages exceeding 8192 bytes, any meaning full java stack trace exceed this limits. Once messages are chunked Fluentd gelf input plugin rejects the chunked message because of unknown format and log statement never reach elasticsearch\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nAllow users to configure the maximumMessageSize\r\n\r\n```quarkus.log.handler.gelf.maximumMessageSize=2000000```\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nMessage chunking and loss of log statements\r\n\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Configure Gelf logging in quarkus\r\n2. Create a log message size greater than 8192 bytes\r\n3. Notice the log statement chunking and underlying log aggregation rejecting the chunked messages (In this case EFK)\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\n```properties\r\n# Add your application.properties here, if applicable.\r\nquarkus.log.handler.gelf.enabled=true\r\nquarkus.log.handler.gelf.host=${GELF_HOST:localhost}\r\nquarkus.log.handler.gelf.port=${GELF_PORT:12201}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n(If applicable, add screenshots to help explain your problem.)\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: amazon linux 2\r\n - Output of `java -version`:  11.0.6\" 2020-01-14\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): GraalVM CE 19.3.1\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 1.4.2-Final\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): mvn\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nJBOSS logmanager JSON logging is outstanding, please support socket appender in addition to existing console, file. So that we can push the logs directly to fluentd tcp source.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co